sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as 业务代码
    participant Loader as ServiceLoader
    participant Diagnostics as ServiceRegistryDiagnostics
    participant Catalog as Debug 诊断静态表
    participant Report as ServiceDiagnosticReport

    App->>Loader: diagnose(ServiceType, alias)
    Loader->>Diagnostics: get(ServiceType, alias)
    alt 未应用 auto-service 插件
        Diagnostics-->>Report: UNAVAILABLE_PLUGIN_NOT_APPLIED + 空列表
    else debuggable=true
        Diagnostics->>Catalog: 按服务类名查候选
        Catalog-->>Diagnostics: REGISTERED + EXCLUDED 全量候选
        Diagnostics-->>Report: AVAILABLE + 候选列表
    else debuggable=false
        Note over Diagnostics: Release 实现不生成候选静态表
        Diagnostics-->>Report: UNAVAILABLE_IN_NON_DEBUG_BUILD + 空列表
    end
    Report-->>Loader: report
    Loader-->>App: availability / entries / counts / aliases
    Note over App,Report: 诊断只读取构建期元数据，不创建服务实例
